---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="blessed" title="Blessed Events" active="blessed-events" pageMark="✨">
  Everything the <strong>Blessed</strong> <a href={`${base}traits`}>trait</a> touches. The first group
  <strong>requires</strong> the trait, so these stories fire only for a character who is already
  Blessed, and they are what the trait is for, because they bring favourable harvests, trades, births
  and truces. The rest <strong>grant</strong> the trait, through the Oracle, a pilgrimage or surviving
  a wildfire. Blessed and <a href={`${base}cursed-events`}>Cursed</a> replace one another, so gaining
  one clears the other. The page collects stories that also appear under their own event class or
  trigger on <a href={`${base}events`}>Story Events</a>. A weight is the value in the XML rather than
  a real in-game chance, because character and empire conditions filter what is eligible.
</EventGroupPage>
